nt thrill of speed and agility  divinity original sin is a throwback to  the role-playing games that I grew up on  it asks you to think and investigate and  pay attention  it has devious puzzles and wonderful  quests and really interesting decisions  and the turn-based combat system is as  close to perfect as I've seen in a long  time this is PC role-playing at its best  and while it can be played in co-op I  found the solo experience could be  second to none  so there you go 5 excellent games sure  to keep gamers engrossed and thrall dand  entertained throughout this holiday  season thanks for watching GameSpot's  Holiday Gift Guide 2014 i'm jeff kannada  and have a very happy holiday  you
 

